WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:01,620
Lin Jingxuan

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,060
Two years no see

3
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:04,610
you are more beautiful

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,680
Rainbow Dash hits me when she's unhappy, so it turns out she's just like you

5
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:12,800
are you crazy

6
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:15,120
Don’t even think about having a child with another woman and asking me to be the mother.

7
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:24,500
Even if Rainbow Dash is cute, it can’t be like this. Is that okay? I was wrong. I was wrong.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,860
Stop making trouble. I have business to do. Don’t pull your hair out. Rainbow Dash will kill you if he sees that you don’t look good.

9
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,540
Rainbow Dash is our child

10
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:46,180
It's the child we gave birth to in parallel time and space. She was bullied and came back to us.

11
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:50,740
I'm going to get off the train, you psycho, you gave birth to a child in two years and turned into a lunatic.

12
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:55,340
I really regret that I ever liked you. You admitted that you liked me. Before, before, before.

13
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,660
That evening two years ago

14
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,060
I'm ready to confess to you
